snippet.description:
HAPPY CHRISTMAS AND HOLYDAYS FROM ALL OF US :DD
This video is just a teaser for the new upcoming update for Codename Engine.. Hopefully not too far away from the release!
The new features showed in this video are... A brand NEW Alphabet rework and a NEW improved Translation System based on XMLs files and the possibility to overwrite files for translations like mods do!

Codename Engine devs for these features:
@Nex_isDumb Translation System Author + Uploaded this video
@FoxFoxDude Translation System Coauthor + NEW Alphabet System Coauthor
@srt2691 NEW Alphabet System Author + Recorded this video
@Vershift NEW improved Alphabet Spritesheet

Tags:
#CodenameEngine #CNE #engine #FridayNightFunkinEngine #FridayNightFunkin #FnFengine #FnF #newgrounds #developer #developers #translations #multiplelanguages #alphabet #teaser

